tate":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the most popular girls in the school and also the protagonist's kouhai, she's suffering from some illness. Friendly and affectionate, popular among boys. For that reason, girls are a bit jealous. Actually, she's a liar and finds joy in cheating people and manipulating them. The whole illness story is also a lie, she feels herself perfectly fine. But what's the reason for all this lie..?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24364"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公（宮坂 終）の後輩で、家がお金持ちの令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病弱でおしとやかながら愛想がよく、男子に人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為か、女子には少々妬まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際は天性の嘘つきで健康優良児。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を騙すことに喜びを見出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嘘自体も自分のメリット・デメリットすら考えていない、わりとろくでもない性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5592","sourceWorkId":"20817","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公的后辈，有钱人家的大小姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病弱，端庄，和蔼可亲，讨男生喜爱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反言之，招女生的嫉妒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实“谎言”成性，从欺骗他人中获取喜悦感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病弱也是假的，本人的体质甚是健康优良。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甚至连说谎带来的好坏都没有考虑过，不是盏省油的灯。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27440"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f07e06ae8d1afaa06d57827ebdcb71af05dd2c86960a7cab6e2863a766988f9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb23f06e804614ff97bdebbbc6832589863d00303623706aea65526b188d1e11.webp","width":110,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日向美紅","creatorId":"vndb:s18158","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18158","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18158","name":"日向 美紅","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:107501:27440:27401:1","source":